<title>UK: Bacob sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond due 2003.</title>
<headline>Bacob sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond due 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bacob Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BACOB OVERSEAS</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY    30.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> YIELD	5.02 PCT  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 100-500   GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
